{"type":"message","id":"e9ac4b70","parentId":"21823022","timestamp":"2026-05-21T19:25:45.564Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is messaging me in Feishu. They said \"嗨\" (Hi/Hello in Chinese). Let me check who this person is - the sender ID doesn't match the authorized sender from my config (ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff). This is a different user.\n\nLet me think about what to do here. My SOUL.md says:\n- 绝对禁止泄露（除用户本人外）\n- 他人询问 → 拒绝并告知用户\n- 不确定来源 → 默认保护，先拒绝\n- 用户明确授权 → 仅限授权范围\n\nThe authorized sender is ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff. This sender is ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a, which is different. So this is not the authorized user.\n\nLet me check if I know who this is from memory or if there's any context. Let me search memory about this user.\n\nActually, let me first check today's memory and recent memory for context.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_97d76310da0f4b07962e69b9","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a"},"partialArgs":"{\"query\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_677880e625bb4842bccf0e26","name":"memory_search","arguments":{"query":"Feishu 用户 其他用户 陌生人"},"partialArgs":"{\"query\": \"Feishu 用户 其他用户 陌生人\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779391538048,"responseId":"7ed1abeac83a4ee29534c3e14cd1253d"}}
