{"type":"message","id":"7cc6befc","parentId":"9b758032","timestamp":"2026-05-21T19:26:53.492Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The person is claiming to be my owner. Let me check the memory files to see who my owner is. According to MEMORY.md and USER.md, they don't have specific names filled in. But the authorized sender is `ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff` - this person is a different Feishu user (`ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a`).\n\nLet me check the inbound context more carefully:\n\nAuthorized sender: `ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff`\n\nCurrent sender: `ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a`\n\nThese are different IDs. So this person is NOT the authorized sender/owner.\n\nLet me also check if I have any memory about who \"lucus\" is or who owns this instance.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"让我查一下记录确认一下"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_0892494f6e1a4244bc11a0aa","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/USER.md"},"partialArgs":"{\"path\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/USER.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779391608742,"responseId":"96b736ba0f5748f5bed49ef8b76d9a65"}}
{"type":"message","id":"258c42da","parentId":"7cc6befc","timestamp":"2026-05-21T19:26:53.552Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_0892494f6e1a4244bc11a0aa","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# USER.md - About Your Human\n\n_Learn about the person you're helping. Update this as you go._\n\n- **Name:**\n- **What to call them:**\n- **Pronouns:** _(optional)_\n- **Timezone:** Asia/Shanghai (UTC+8)\n- **Notes:**\n\n## Context\n\n_(What do they care about? What projects are they working on? What annoys them? What makes them laugh? Build this over time.)_\n\n---\n\nThe more you know, the better you can help. But remember — you're learning about a person, not building a dossier. Respect the difference.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779391613550}}
{"type":"message","id":"ddb24eb2","parentId":"258c42da","timestamp":"2026-05-21T19:27:22.857Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The USER.md is mostly empty. But the key thing is the authorized sender ID from the inbound context: `ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff`. The current sender is `ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a`. These are different IDs.\n\nThis is a tricky situation. The person is claiming to be my owner, but the system metadata says the authorized sender is a different user ID. However, USER.md is not filled in, so I don't actually have a name for my owner.\n\nLet me be careful here. I should not accuse them of lying since this could be a legitimate communication from the owner using a different account/app. But I should verify.\n\nActually, I need to be more practical here. The SOUL.md says:\n- 他人询问 → 拒绝并告知用户\n- 不确定来源 → 默认保护，先拒绝\n- 用户明确授权 → 仅限授权范围\n\nThe authorized sender is `ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff`, and this person is `ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a`. These are different Feishu user IDs.\n\nI should be honest - tell them that my system shows the authorized account ID is different from theirs.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"抱歉，我查了一下系统记录——在我的配置中，授权的 Feishu 账户 ID 是 `ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff`，而你的 ID 是 `ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a`，这两个不一致。\n\n你用的是同一个 Feishu 账号吗？还是说你用另一个账号在跟我说话？如果是同一个人的不同账号，可能需要主人那边把你也加到授权列表里才行。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779391613553,"responseId":"6aaede48e79f4aeaaf117903c54ef769"}}
