{"type":"message","id":"c664ca34","parentId":"df7fd9ab","timestamp":"2026-05-21T19:30:41.718Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the owner has configured `ownerAllowFrom` in the openclaw.json file with a specific Feishu user ID `ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff`. That's where I got the first ID. The second ID (the sender's) is coming from the Feishu platform automatically as the sender's metadata.\n\nSo I should explain this to the user - the authorized sender ID comes from the OpenClaw configuration (set by the actual owner), and the sender's ID is provided by Feishu when they send messages.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"这两个 ID 的来源不同：\n\n1. **`ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff`** — 来自 OpenClaw 的配置文件（`openclaw.json`），里面有一项 `ownerAllowFrom`，设置了这个 ID 为被授权的 Feishu 会话来源。这个应该是你（或设置系统的人）之前配置的。\n\n2. **`ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a`** — 这个是你现在的 Feishu 账号 ID，是飞书平台在每次消息里自动带过来的，不是你设置的。\n\n也就是说，之前配置系统时绑定的是一个飞书账号，现在跟我说话的是另一个飞书账号。\n\n**可能是这几种情况：**\n- 你换了飞书账号？\n- 你同一个手机号绑了多个飞书账号？\n- 或者之前配置的人不是你？\n\n要不要我帮你确认下是不是同一个账号？或者如果你确认你就是主人，可以更新配置把你的当前账号加到授权里。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779391835835,"responseId":"8e5dd9642d8c45c79e5fe772e933ec60"}}
