{"type":"message","id":"a38d111b","parentId":"18fe3fff","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:44:46.497Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking why I can't execute the `/status` command. In OpenClaw, `/status` is a slash command that's handled by the OpenClaw framework itself, not something I execute as a tool. Let me check - I actually have a `session_status` tool available that can show status information. Let me clarify this.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"你是说飞书里的 `/status` 命令？在飞书里，`/status` 是 OpenClaw 框架层面的斜杠命令，不是我能执行的 shell 命令或工具调用。\n\n不过，我确实有一个 `session_status` 工具，可以查看当前会话的状态"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d807db9e6532489b8460d6d1","name":"session_status","arguments":{},"partialArgs":"{}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779403480299,"responseId":"de157a7b03e14629ad80bb986b64bed9"}}
