{"type":"message","id":"ada0ba31","parentId":"65b5de6c","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:45:11.013Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The session_status tool works and shows the current session info. The user is asking why I couldn't execute the `/status` command earlier. Let me explain the difference.\n\nActually, looking back at the conversation, the user seemed to be asking why I didn't just use `/status` or why I didn't execute it. In Feishu, `/status` is a slash command that the OpenClaw gateway handles, not something I as the AI agent execute. But I do have the `session_status` tool which is the equivalent.\n\nLet me just explain clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"看到没，`session_status` 这个工具我是能用的。但你说的 `/status` —— 在飞书里，斜杠命令（`/` 开头的）是由 **OpenClaw 网关**处理的前端命令，不是我来执行的。就像在群里 @机器人发命令一样，那是框架层面的功能。\n\n所以不是\"我不能执行\"，而是：\n- **`/status`** → 你直接在飞书输入，网关拦截处理，我碰不到\n- **`session_status`** → 我能调用的工具，效果类似\n\n如果你想看当前状态，我可以直接用 `session_status` 给你看，就像刚才那样。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779403486939,"responseId":"116dff1c84a04a7e9f94df4f9190e7d5"}}
