{"type":"message","id":"910d1e72","parentId":"00714ca8","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:48:34.258Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see it clearly. The `commands` section in openclaw.json has:\n\n```json\n\"commands\": {\n    \"native\": \"auto\",\n    \"nativeSkills\": \"auto\",\n    \"restart\": true,\n    \"ownerDisplay\": \"raw\",\n    \"ownerAllowFrom\": [\n      \"feishu:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n    ]\n  }\n```\n\nThis is the key! `/status` is a **slash command** that falls under the `commands` configuration. The `ownerAllowFrom` list only allows `feishu:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff` to execute commands like `/status`, `/new`, `/reset`, etc.\n\nThe user's current ID is `ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a`, which is NOT in the `ownerAllowFrom` list. That's why `/status` doesn't work — the gateway checks this list before routing slash commands.\n\nBut wait, the user said \"之前可以\" (it used to work before). So maybe the previous version didn't enforce `ownerAllowFrom` for `/status` command? Or perhaps the config was different before?\n\nActually, looking at it more carefully - the `ownerAllowFrom` was probably configured when the system was first set up with the `ou_f78...` account. The user might be the same person but using a different Feishu account, or the account ID changed.\n\nLet me explain this to the user clearly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了。原因在这 — 你的配置文件里：\n\n```json\n\"commands\": {\n    \"ownerAllowFrom\": [\"feishu:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"]\n}\n```\n\n**`/status` 是一个斜杠命令（slash command）**，由 OpenClaw 网关直接处理。网关会根据 `commands.ownerAllowFrom` 来检查谁有权限执行斜杠命令。\n\n你现在用的 Feishu 账号 ID 是 `ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a`，但配置里只授权了 `ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff`，所以网关直接把你的 `/status` 请求拦下来了。\n\n**那为什么之前可以？** 可能有两个原因：\n1. **以前你用的是那个授权的账号**，后来切换了账号\n2. **配置文件中途改过** — 比如重新部署时换了授权 ID\n\n你能查一下 — 你 Feishu 上是不是有两个账号？或者最近有没有换过绑定的手机号/邮箱？如果确认你就是主人，我可以帮你把当前账号加进 `ownerAllowFrom`。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779403700468,"responseId":"b28308ad381c4036af01cb60bb19853a"}}
